    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00028",
      "en_US": "Please come see me when you are ready.\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00029",
      "en_US": [
        "Both Trainers have chosen the\n",
        "Pokémon {STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0}.\r",
        "Please confer with the other Trainer\n",
        "and choose different Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00030",
      "en_US": [
        "Both Trainers have chosen the Pokémon\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 0, 0} and {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Please confer with the other Trainer\n",
        "and choose different Pokémon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00031",
      "en_US": [
        "You must save the game before\n",
        "I show you in. Is that OK?{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00032",
      "en_US": "Right this way, please!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00033",
      "en_US": [
        "We’ve missed you!\r",
        "You must save the game before you\n",
        "resume your challenge. Please wait."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00034",
      "en_US": [
        "Excuse me!\r",
        "You didn’t save before you quit your\n",
        "challenge last time.\r",
        "Because of that, you have been\n",
        "disqualified from your challenge!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00035",
      "en_US": [
        "Congratulations!\r",
        "In honor of your victory, we present\n",
        "you with this commemorative print!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00036",
      "en_US": [
        "The Gold Print was added to\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00037",
      "en_US": [
        "The Silver Print was added to\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s Vs. Recorder!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00038",
      "en_US": "SINGLE BATTLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00039",
      "en_US": "DOUBLE BATTLE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00040",
      "en_US": "TAKE CHALLENGE"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00041",
      "en_US": "INFO"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00042",
      "en_US": "CANCEL"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00043",
      "en_US": [
        "One Trainer should select\n",
        "“BECOME LEADER.”\r",
        "The other Trainer must select\n",
        "“JOIN GROUP.”{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00044",
      "en_US": [
        "We need to launch DS Wireless\n",
        "Communications.{YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00045",
      "en_US": [
        "You must save the game before I\n",
        "show you in. Please wait."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00046",
      "en_US": [
        "The game board is like your life.\r",
        "It goes round and round\n",
        "as your fortune goes up and down...\f",
        "How did that sound?\r",
        "It almost made some kind of sense,\n",
        "didn’t it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00047",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s an aspect of luck in\n",
        "Pokémon battles...\r",
        "The Battle Arcade reminds me of that,\n",
        "decisively. Very decisively..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00048",
      "en_US": [
        "What quality is most needed here?\n",
        "Is it strength?\f",
        "Wisdom?\f",
        "Luck?\f",
        "No. The answer is...flexibility.\f",
        "That’s what my gut tells me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00049",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know what I mean by\n",
        "“stop on the spot”?\r",
        "It’s the skill of stopping the\n",
        "game board at the right time!\r",
        "But, remember...\f",
        "If you don’t stop it in 30 seconds,\n",
        "it will stop by itself."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00050",
      "en_US": [
        "I thought I was fully prepared with my\n",
        "prized Pokémon, but I had to swap them\f",
        "and use my opponent’s instead!\f",
        "I need to rethink all my strategies."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00051",
      "en_US": [
        "I chose Pokémon that are good at\n",
        "attacking.\f",
        "But my opponent went for speed!\r",
        "Next time, I’ll try Pokémon with\n",
        "superior speed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00052",
      "en_US": [
        "There are advantages to be gained from\n",
        "“stop on the spot” skills!\r",
        "But there’s a lot of fun in letting the\n",
        "unknown hand of luck decide..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00053",
      "en_US": [
        "The game board shows better choices\n",
        "the greater the wins you achieve...\r",
        "Could this board be alive...?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00054",
      "en_US": [
        "Did you figure this one out?\r",
        "Paralyzing events here won’t\n",
        "affect Ground-type Pokémon.\r",
        "You should tell everybody!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0110_D32R0601_00055",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll tell you something.\r",
        "Poisoning or freezing events can be\n",
        "made ineffective.\r",
        "...If the Pokémon’s type or ability\n",
        "protects it from such status problems.\r",
        "Might be worth knowing!"
      ]
    }
  ]
